3	// Talking to Herdr.
4	//
5	// Every call goes through the binary named by HERDR_BIN_PATH, which Herdr
6	// injects into plugin commands. `windowsHide` is on everywhere: without it a
7	// console process spawned from a parent that has no visible console pops a new
8	// console window, and this plugin spawns one per token write.
