3	// The three blocks this plugin owns inside Herdr's config.toml — the tab-bar
4	// entry in `[ui]`, the `[theme.custom]` override and the `[ui.sidebar.*]`
5	// rows — and the operations on them: inspect, install/repair, remove, and the
6	// appearance switch that rewrites the two that carry colours. Each block sits
