143	     * Set a custom editor component via factory function.
144	     * Pass undefined to restore the default editor.
145	     *
146	     * The factory receives:
147	     * - `theme`: EditorTheme for styling borders and autocomplete
148	     * - `keybindings`: KeybindingsManager for app-level keybindings
